      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解世界經濟與大中華地區的發展趨勢與經營策略",
      "describe_en": "Understand the development  and business strategies of the world economy and Greater China"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "培養學生對國際經濟發展分析的能力",
      "describe_en": "Cultivating students' ability to analyze international economic development."
    }
